<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Dec 13 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 7225, tin down 60, lead up 625, zinc down 2925, aluminium down 2525, nickel up 876, aluminium alloy down 400</p>
</text>
